Jerick Shi: Yeah, I think the question is, if you play these repeated games, or, like, any of these deceptive scenarios in general, what will happen if you just keep repeating these games? And if you see a pattern, maybe in the first 10 rounds, will the same pattern emerge in, like, 100 rounds, for example? At least this is how I'm gonna be interpreting the question. So…

